[{"client_msg_id":"82F8FD5F-F8C7-4C20-8A29-B322144306AE","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"asterisk使って先にnでファイル内一通り確認してから.連打かも","ts":"1635084615.127100","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1635084638.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rlq="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce269ece-7068-46a2-8c2b-ddad33a3bd4f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"視界の範囲内にあって問題なさそうだったらnを省くくらい？","ts":"1635084454.125900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5NzQb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0feb8cac-172d-4459-9eff-6e3045f3cdc1","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"naruhodo","ts":"1635084445.125700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2=2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"443741fa-c81f-4ccd-949d-95829b5f7f1d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そういえばなんだかんだ `cgn` 使うときも `n.` を繰り返すようにしてるなー（置換前に問題ないか確かめたい・場合によってはスキップしたい場合が多いので）","ts":"1635084420.124800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nKcc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"308f9249-b8c3-4194-a5d9-aa2032ba3f07","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"vimtips_acのネタは一応決めてる、プラグイン開発者向けだからウケは悪いだろうけど思い付かなかったらそのまま行く","ts":"1635084325.123800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qve"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b0b69e4-5e20-482a-ab30-5c9773fe0ced","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"はっはっは、まだ 10 月ですよ。みなさん気が早いなぁ (フラグ)","ts":"1635084298.123000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9qO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffee798e-792c-4b98-8946-304b6e4e67b3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"負けたッ(何にだ)","ts":"1635084280.122400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nuv8/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5C20F7EB-473F-4A2C-8983-AB72686F52BF","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"cgnはn.じゃなくて.だけで行けて便利","ts":"1635084279.122300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yNAl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfe97d6c-8ee0-452c-89a8-097d16ac849f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`/\u0026lt;pattern\u0026gt;/e` は今年の Vim short Tips のネタにしようかな（140字に収まるか微妙だけど）","ts":"1635084244.120900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bpE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"719c8918-9033-4245-b226-5d2206924eb8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"cgn自体これ見て知りました\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/yutkat/status/1205503642985521153?s=19\u003e","ts":"1635084215.120600","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/yutkat|@yutkat\u003e: Vimで置換するとき無意識に :%s/aa/xx/gcを使ってませんか？\n実は別の方法もあります。それが cgn\n\n使い方は簡単\n1 置換したい文字を検索する(/, *)\n2 cgn (文字が消えるが慌てない)\n3 InsertModeになるので置換後の文字を入力\n4 Esc\n5 nで次へ\n6 . で再度置換\n7 あとはn.を繰り返すだけ!\n#vimtips_ac","id":1,"author_name":"yutkat","author_subname":"@yutkat","author_link":"https://twitter.com/yutkat/status/1205503642985521153","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1249871687006339074/Zw6P3xoh_normal.png","text":"Vimで置換するとき無意識に :%s/aa/xx/gcを使ってませんか？\n実は別の方法もあります。それが cgn\n\n使い方は簡単\n1 置換したい文字を検索する(/, *)\n2 cgn (文字が消えるが慌てない)\n3 InsertModeになるので置換後の文字を入力\n4 Esc\n5 nで次へ\n6 . で再度置換\n7 あとはn.を繰り返すだけ!\n#vimtips_ac","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1576249440,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/yutkat/status/1205503642985521153?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/yutkat/status/1205503642985521153?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qSHz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8360e768-2f08-469e-a1ad-e385c4a8a76e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`/\u0026lt;pattern\u0026gt;/e` はこういうときに使えるんですよねー。すでに特定のパターンで検索しているときは、 `//e` と打つだけでもよいです","ts":"1635084210.120400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"II14"}]},{"client_msg_id":"260707b7-4c14-4ad3-b9a9-e68ba489aed1","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"置換を意識していたので検索からやるという発想がありませんでした。","ts":"1635084153.120100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5VL="}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e397ab0-1760-4408-8be9-4901631d5d81","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あ、はいそういうことです。それは良い手ですね！ありがとうございます！","ts":"1635084064.119400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1EKk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1470989-f89b-49df-8973-cff3903c92eb","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"すいません、やりたいことよく分かってなかったんですが、\n`renv` → `renvパッケージ`\nにしたいということですか？\nだったら私は `/renv/e` で検索しますね。そうするとカーソルが検索文字列の最後にうつるので、\n`aパッケージ\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;` からの `n.n.n.` とやることで `cgn` の要領で同じことができます（もちろん途中スキップも可能）","ts":"1635083898.118600","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1635083935.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4698211-141d-4b13-a6f6-c0364d2aaf7b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"通常の検索だとマッチした部分全体がハイライトされるんですけど、 `\\zs` `\\ze` を使えばハイライトされる箇所を絞ることができるんですよね。\nで、それは `gn` で選択するときの範囲にも影響するという。","ts":"1635083475.115200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LINnw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c06b9d8a-9783-4885-9f0f-876afc41905d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なぜかperl-patternsの下に書いてあるな\n```次のものは Vim だけの機能です:\n- パターンのマジックを変更する:  \\v \\V \\m \\M\n   (バックスラッシュだらけになるのを防げます)\n- 任意にマッチするアトム列:  \\%[atoms]\n- \\\u0026amp;   (\"\\\u0026amp;\" と \"\\|\" は、\"and\" と \"or\" の関係です。複数のブランチを同じ場所で\n  マッチさせることができます)\n- 行や列を指定してマッチングする:  \\%5l \\%5c \\%5v\n- 正規表現にマッチしたものとして返される範囲を設定する:  \\zs \\ze```","ts":"1635083028.113600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pC6"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        */\\zs*\n\\zs     [] の中以外のパターンのどの場所でもマッチして、マッチの開始地点を設定\n        します。このアトムの次の文字は、マッチした文字列の 1 文字目です。\n        |/zero-width|\n        例:  \n                /^\\s*\\zsif\n        これは、行頭からスペースを無視して、\"if\" にマッチします。\n        複数回の繰り返しで使った場合は、最後にマッチしたものが使われます。\n        例:  \n                /\\(.\\{-}\\zsFab\\)\\{3}\n        これは、3 番目に現れた \"Fab\" にマッチします。\n```","ts":"1635082957.113300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a909e2a8-d9cc-4d50-87b2-e118978b296d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h \\zs","ts":"1635082957.113200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gqtec"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a00b13fb-a03e-4978-91d5-9361ce984534","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"独自ですね","ts":"1635082951.113000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d1=R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89a3f0a8-f1d9-464f-9982-706aa35e9b87","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"vim独自の正規表現ですかね……？便利","ts":"1635082942.112800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tMftj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bf45d77-e855-4eec-9f1b-623c553b995b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"行けそうな気がしてきた","ts":"1635082776.112300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uWG5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c47a3e7-b1c4-4054-b984-904abc861a98","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\\( \\) で囲む部分を \\zs \\ze にしたら cgn と似たような要領で行けないですかね？","ts":"1635082675.111400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IqRMH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1f8e967-2299-48e6-a0bf-b27976068f32","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Qfreplace便利","ts":"1635081995.108700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SThQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f76bf4d2-e45b-4bdf-a902-674c9d8cdb76","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"この場合は cgn は使えないですね。Qfreplace でできそう","ts":"1635081972.108400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sasu","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P8qRX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2aa82891-294d-4199-9c11-559eea89ea49","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"cgnだとまあ無理ですね","ts":"1635081971.108300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fTfO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f867ab4f-737b-4670-9979-3d2215a427ae","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"具体的な要望は「hogeパッケージ」のパッケージが抜けている場合に追記したいが、「hoge::」など特定のキワードが続く場合は無視したい、みたいな感じでした。ただ、キーワードに抜けがあるかもしれないので、`gc`していたという。\n`:%s/renv\\([^:-パ]\\)/renvパッケージ\\1/gc`\n\n`cgn`だと置換に `\\1`とかしにくそうな気がする……？けどQfreplaceならあるいは感ありますね。","ts":"1635081907.107800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AoG0g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9645aa6-2f94-4de5-a4ae-1b3d1ccd2242","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私も :s の gc は窮屈なので基本使わないですね","ts":"1635081614.105200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ok9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11aef0f5-2659-4d6e-96d4-be9e5db70afb","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"Qfreplaceを使っちゃう","ts":"1635081412.104600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M5D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4ec6b80-608a-4f1a-a945-ecc0dbade10b","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"あー失礼。gcでインタラクティブな感じなのか。使ったことないなぁ。qして `u` のundoか、`g;` で戻るしかないかな","ts":"1635081353.104200","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1635081371.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mc5D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d03ffe77-8fbe-417e-bd93-84f330ae3b50","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶん戻る方法はなさそうかなぁ","ts":"1635081290.103400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rXK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81fe90ee-1e57-4382-9106-640b46128275","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"答えではないけど、検索してcgnとドットリピートで置換する方が楽だったりする","ts":"1635081161.102200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DrR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7a638bc-2792-4cfb-a53c-ba44668c70a5","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"実は試してたんですが、改めてやっても戻れないですね……。","ts":"1635081106.101500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":