ist.txt```\nかな","ts":"1635075429.094200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oy7qi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6502c139-19fe-4fae-bfbc-54ae74b5e1dd","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"シェルスクリプトに `pacman -Syu [package_name]` を書いておくとか…？","ts":"1635075289.093400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l3r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed0e2bee-0a34-4d4f-849f-365c65d94c2d","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"今Manjaroでdotfilesを作っているんですが、pacmanでPythonのrequirements.txtみたいな事は実現できるんでしょうか？","ts":"1635075143.092800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZYNo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ab45e60-50e9-4789-8840-3cd72bbf08ce","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"面倒でも明示的にやるのを好みます","ts":"1635046999.090900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QPhjE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6301ff3b-1f32-4c99-a65f-076bb3693cca","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私は暗黙的な指定は好きじゃないので","ts":"1635046989.090600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qGT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67d1763f-bd52-46e1-b5c0-d53ebbe4cf16","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"だからdenite.nvimでは単純化したはず","ts":"1635046871.090000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7HFY4HFY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QcEV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"486da73c-5d63-47a8-8f6f-e48baa18cbc8","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"uniteではそこも頑張ってやってた気がするんですが、簡単にバグるんです","ts":"1635046852.089500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gj2o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"064b9ab9-b657-481e-9171-0843d2d75f23","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それは実装が複雑になってしまいます","ts":"1635046823.088800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wecE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be4649ea-f675-4803-b145-3dfef5a66f14","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そもそも、それをやる場合継承ツリーを保存しておく必要がありますが","ts":"1635046811.088400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jE1="}]},{"client_msg_id":"a965a700-0db4-45f3-ab10-ba7e57cc4ab7","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"なるほどー\nじゃあ `denite#custom#action` で派生kindも含めて羅列するぐらいかー","ts":"1635046794.087800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"26XY+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6f6cd1b-cd31-4c50-8d89-28f6dfeef8fe","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"残念ながら対応していません","ts":"1635046315.086000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KdCH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1938f97a-c3bb-42f0-b088-b68018064831","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"denite.nvimで特定のkindに後から追加したカスタムアクションを派生kindでも使えるようにするのって不可能ですか？\nkind/directoryに色々アクションを追加するプラグインを作ってみようかと思いましたが、directoryを継承しているdirmarkその他でも一括で使えるようになってほしいです。\ndenite.nvim本体のkind/directory自体にアクションを追加するPRを出さないとだめ？","ts":"1635045215.085400","edited":{"user":"U7HFY4HFY","ts":"1635045329.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gv48"}]}]
